WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.700
So you mentioned rationing earlier.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.760
How did rationing affect life on campus?

3
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.000
Well, we were privileged is about the best I can say it.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.440
We were not really affected.

5
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.840
None of the students?

6
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.660
Oh, some of them were, sure.

7
00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.120
But I’m talking about the athletes.

8
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.753
But the football players, yeah.

9
00:00:21.753 --> 00:00:22.007
The athletes.

10
00:00:22.007 --> 00:00:28.280
[laughing] We had what was called the training table.

11
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.680
They probably still have it, I’m sure.

12
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.840
But that’s where we’d eat every day,

13
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:41.800
on the training table and we’d have people [laughing] . . . We’d have people lined up watching us go down to the training table,

14
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:48.340
wishing that they could . . . Tell us how they wished they could go down and eat on the training table.

15
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:54.420
Because we had everything, we had . . . At that time, you couldn’t get beef,

16
00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:59.380
you couldn’t get . . . There were just a lot of things you couldn’t . . . couldn’t get to eat.

17
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:01.460
We always had big steaks.

18
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.700
We had everything we wanted.
